Dear inlinedoc developers,

 

First of all, thank you very much for developing such a useful and intuitive
inline documentation system.  You have reduced the burden on an otherwise
very ardous task.

 

I do have one query though. When the usage tag gets transformed into the Rd
format, it appears to format with a new lines, every comma.

 

In my argument list, one of the arguments has a vector as the default. This
